{"reports":[{"id":"raken-bluesky-2024-11-01","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2024-11-01","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-00.jpg","ts":1730484600000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-01.jpg","ts":1730484600000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-02.jpg","ts":1730484600000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-03.jpg","ts":1730671080000,"cap":""}],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-04.jpg","ts":1730671080000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-05.jpg","ts":1730671080000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-06.jpg","ts":1730671080000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-07.jpg","ts":1730671140000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-08.jpg","ts":1730671140000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-09.jpg","ts":1730671140000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-10.jpg","ts":1730671140000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-11.jpg","ts":1730671200000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-12.jpg","ts":1730671200000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-13.jpg","ts":1730671200000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-14.jpg","ts":1730671200000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-15.jpg","ts":1730671200000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-01-16.jpg","ts":1730671200000,"cap":""}],"wx":[{"t":42,"c":"Clear","w":"11","p":".0","h":"89"},{"t":59,"c":"Clear","w":"20","p":".0","h":"57"},{"t":69,"c":"Clear","w":"13","p":".0","h":"38"}],"notes":"Today the concrete pump arrived onsite and setup at 7:15am. Iron horse crew along with Luis was (11) arrived at 7:30am. A.T.E. (Ted) was there ready for the first mixers to show up. 8:00am mixers arrived with first loads. Ted tested the first 2 trucks.\nSlump-4\" plus or minus 1\". Air content-6% plus or minus 1.5%. Regarding concrete specs after testing all test results were good. Pump was pumping concrete at 8:15am. I'm having Ted retest a truck every 50 yards poured for slump/air content. East octagon poured by 11:00am. All tests look good. 12:35pm both octagons completed with all water stops and concrete. Iron horse crew then did finish work until completed. Luis said his crew was leaving this weekend to families. They would be onsite Monday morning and strip all concrete forms and clean up area. Tuesday morning crew will start installing scaffolding and forms to complete wall dowels to elevation and 2'overlap. Mje wants to back fill the footings Tuesday as well. This short schedule only works if the weather permits. Rain predicted from Saturday to Tuesday of next week. Hopefully it all goes around the project because that ground gets very difficult to drive on. I had Mje replace the berm that was removed so the pump could easily access the pit. Site looks really good.\nAdditional to my report on 11.1.24. Total amount of concrete poured for slab was 315 yards.","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2024-11-01.png","sigTs":1730671260000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2024-11-05","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2024-11-05","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-05-00.jpg","ts":1730852820000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-05-01.jpg","ts":1730852820000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-05-02.jpg","ts":1730852820000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-05-03.jpg","ts":1730852820000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-05-04.jpg","ts":1730852820000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-05-05.jpg","ts":1730852820000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-05-06.jpg","ts":1730852820000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-05-07.jpg","ts":1730852820000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-05-08.jpg","ts":1730852820000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-05-09.jpg","ts":1730852820000,"cap":""}],"wx":[{"t":44,"c":"Overcast","w":"13","p":".0","h":"96"},{"t":54,"c":"Partially cloudy","w":"12","p":".0","h":"58"},{"t":60,"c":"Clear","w":"8","p":".0","h":"38"}],"notes":"Iron Horse showed up at the job site at approximately 8:00 am. Site conditions were very sloppy because of all the mud from the recent rain. Workers hand carried forms into the octagon pit because too dangerous for equipment to bring the forms down into the pit. Erection of the forms for the vertical walls began. I reminded Luis that the sleeve for the equalizing valve needs to be installed. No rain in the forecast for tomorrow.","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2024-11-05.png","sigTs":1730853300000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2024-11-06","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2024-11-06","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-00.jpg","ts":1730915100000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-01.jpg","ts":1730915460000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-02.jpg","ts":1730915520000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-03.jpg","ts":1730915640000,"cap":""}],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-04.jpg","ts":1730948400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-05.jpg","ts":1730948400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-06.jpg","ts":1730948400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-07.jpg","ts":1730948400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-08.jpg","ts":1730948400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-09.jpg","ts":1730948400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-10.jpg","ts":1730948400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-11.jpg","ts":1730948400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-12.jpg","ts":1730948400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-06-13.jpg","ts":1730948400000,"cap":""}],"wx":[{"t":41,"c":"Clear","w":"8","p":".0","h":"97"},{"t":56,"c":"Clear","w":"18","p":".0","h":"56"},{"t":60,"c":"Partially cloudy","w":"13","p":".0","h":"54"}],"notes":"Iron Horse crew was onsite 7:00. Job foreman Luis was not onsite. Called him and he was in Texas, said his son, Luis Jr. was there in his place. Although Luis Jr. was capable, there was no real handoff between Sr. & Jr.\nWest pit lower forms were completed and they began work on the East pit lower forms. Also began extending vertical rebar on the West pit. MJE to begin backfilling up to the foundation height tomorrow. This will help with the rain due to fall Friday.","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2024-11-06.png","sigTs":1730948880000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2024-11-07","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2024-11-07","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-07-00.jpg","ts":1731026340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-07-01.jpg","ts":1731026340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-07-02.jpg","ts":1731026340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-07-03.jpg","ts":1731026340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-07-04.jpg","ts":1731026340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-07-05.jpg","ts":1731026340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-07-06.jpg","ts":1731026340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-07-07.jpg","ts":1731026340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-07-08.jpg","ts":1731026340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-07-09.jpg","ts":1731026340000,"cap":""}],"wx":[{"t":44,"c":"Partially cloudy","w":"10","p":".0","h":"93"},{"t":54,"c":"Partially cloudy","w":"13","p":".0","h":"59"},{"t":55,"c":"Partially cloudy","w":"15","p":".0","h":"59"}],"notes":"8 man Iron Horse crew started 7:00. Foreman Luis Jr. arrived 10:00. West pit inside lower forms set. East pit mid level forms completed.\nBegan upper rebar work on East pit. Met with Hayden, Aaron of MJE and Luis Jr. to bring up OSHA regulations on using harnesses with lanyards when working on scaffolding and scissor lifts. Rain expected tomorrow so if possible work on Saturday and Sunday.\nAlso started backfilling pit to height of foundation.","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2024-11-07.png","sigTs":"","source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2024-11-08","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2024-11-08","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[],"att":[],"wx":[{"t":45,"c":"Rain, Overcast","w":"12","p":".05","h":"97"},{"t":45,"c":"Rain, Overcast","w":"16","p":".09","h":"96"},{"t":46,"c":"Rain, Overcast","w":"20","p":".07","h":"97"}],"notes":"No work today due to heavy rain","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2024-11-08.png","sigTs":1731110160000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2024-11-11","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2024-11-11","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-11-00.jpg","ts":1731377340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-11-01.jpg","ts":1731377340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-11-02.jpg","ts":1731377340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-11-03.jpg","ts":1731377340000,"cap":""}],"wx":[{"t":38,"c":"Clear","w":"4","p":".0","h":"96"},{"t":68,"c":"Clear","w":"7","p":".0","h":"40"},{"t":69,"c":"Clear","w":"7","p":".0","h":"38"}],"notes":"Iron Horse crew showed up at 8:00. 7 guys, crew foreman Luis Jr. got there around 12:00, late due to truck problems. Site was \ufb02ooded and very muddy because of the rain Friday. The crew did work over the weekend but was slowed down because of the wet conditions. Rebar on the west pit was raised up to the top level at about 70% complete. The SS pipe and \ufb02ange was delivered to the bone yard area and I had them put the material in my truck. I left around 2:00 to bring the material to MJE\"s shop in Montezuma so they could weld the \ufb02ange and pipe and get it installed by Wednesday for a possible concrete pour later this week.","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2024-11-11.png","sigTs":1731378000000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2024-11-12","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2024-11-12","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-00.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-01.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-02.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-03.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""}],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-04.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-05.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-06.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-07.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-08.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-09.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-10.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-11.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-12.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-13.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-14.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-15.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-16.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-17.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-18.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-12-19.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""}],"wx":[{"t":46,"c":"Clear","w":"10","p":".0","h":"95"},{"t":64,"c":"Clear","w":"21","p":".0","h":"54"},{"t":66,"c":"Clear","w":"25","p":".0","h":"52"}],"notes":"Concrete crew started at 7am. I asked them to use the light tower supplied to them when working in limited light. Very muddy conditions still from last week's rain event. Iron horse pumping water off the slab trapped by water stops. Mje fixing erosion on ramp down to the pit and backfilling footings. Starting second wall dowels on west pit. Luis stated they will be ready to pour concrete next week. No rain in the ten day forecast for Lewis Kansas.","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2024-11-12.png","sigTs":1731465240000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2024-11-13","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2024-11-13","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-00.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-01.jpg","ts":1731464640000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-02.jpg","ts":1731538740000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-03.jpg","ts":1731542700000,"cap":""}],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-04.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-05.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-06.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-07.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-08.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-09.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-10.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-11.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-12.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-13.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-13-14.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""}],"wx":[{"t":46,"c":"Partially cloudy","w":"13","p":".0","h":"87"},{"t":55,"c":"Partially cloudy","w":"31","p":".0","h":"53"},{"t":59,"c":"Clear","w":"23","p":".0","h":"37"}],"notes":"Iron horse crew of (8) continues to work rebar, dowels and forms. It rained .25 last night and the site conditions are wet and muddy. SS \ufb02ange is onsite now. Conex storage container to be delivered Friday. Rain event predicted for Monday.","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2024-11-13.png","sigTs":1731549840000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2024-11-14","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2024-11-14","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-00.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-01.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-02.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-03.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""}],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-04.jpg","ts":1731549540000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-05.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-06.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-07.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-08.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-09.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-10.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-11.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-12.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-13.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-14.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-15.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-16.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-17.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-18.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-19.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-20.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-21.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2024-11-14-22.jpg","ts":1731637020000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/phot