scussion.\nPump truck arrived 12:45pm. Ted was onsite for testing and filling cylinders for breaks. Slump/4\" Temp/53* Air test/6.5%. Concrete pour started and completed by 2:45. All tests performed passed. Vibrating all concrete to bottom of wall's. The pour went very smoothly. My apologies for the late sub mental of report.","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2024-11-27.png","sigTs":1732908180000,"source":"Raken PDF"}]}